@dhicoc/dsh-codex-web-search-mcp README · Prerequisites：The plugin relies on these npm packages to distribute cross-platform binaries:

- `@dhicoc/dsh-codex-web-search-mcp`: this dsh plugin;
- `codex-web-search-mcp`: the cross-platform command and its platform binary dependencies;
- `@dhicoc/codex-web-search-mcp-*`: prebuilt per-platform binaries.

@dhicoc/dsh-codex-web-search-mcp README · Fallback: native dsh MCP config (no plugin)：dsh's built-in `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` already reads `.mcp.json` / `~/.dsh/mcp.json`. To get the same effect without the plugin, add:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "codex-web-search": {
      "command": "codex-web-search-mcp"

or append to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:

```yaml
- insert:
    - id: mcp-codex-web-search
      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client'
      config:

---
